"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974763_975564920651188_1563319613524578103_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ApvCkyHT55YQ7kNvwEu8S4b&_nc_oc=AdoSkixOFL-PGbh941mZGxTgJyrGqq2b_VKkvg-4h0-8eQRjYDEU8gCoGgTL7yNUQwE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKICALaB8mHkIEodXf9DuOHfrqcqqKlxHPYZJi315oz6w&oe=6A9984F6"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Ultimechs", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Simulation", "id": "331529188132278"}, {"topic_name": "Rhythm", "id": "1672577396871977"}, {"topic_name": "Learning", "id": "1043107547362485"}], "release_date": 1663261182, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "24622891997355931", "release_type": "MANAGED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "5118731164870081", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1714109688945620"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1434241977089761", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ultimechs", "keywords": ["Multijoueur", "gratuit", "JcJ", "Sports", "action"], "long_description": "Pr\u00e9parez-vous \u00e0 prendre d\u2019assaut l\u2019ar\u00e8ne et \u00e0 d\u00e9marrer votre saison de rookie : l\u2019avenir m\u00e9tallique du sport d\u00e9barque gratuitement bient\u00f4t  !\n\nDans Ultimechs, vous pilotez un Mech high-tech et tentez de devenir le champion du Superball. Atteignez l\u2019extr\u00e9mit\u00e9 du terrain avec votre co\u00e9quipier, puis pr\u00e9parez-vous \u00e0 sprinter, bloquer, frapper et marquer tous azimuts ! Votre objectif : d\u00e9crocher la victoire.\n\nTenir la distance pour devenir champion de Superball ne se r\u00e9sume pas \u00e0 faire le plein de carburant et de matos. Le jeu collectif est crucial : il faut communiquer, \u00e9tablir des strat\u00e9gies et r\u00e9agir avec votre co\u00e9quipier pour s\u2019imposer lors de comp\u00e9titions 2c2. Vous \u00eates plut\u00f4t du genre loup solitaire ? Les joueurs qui veulent s\u2019attribuer toute la gloire (ou ne pas \u00e9bruiter leurs \u00e9checs) peuvent jouer en 1c1.\n\nCombinant une technologie futuriste et tous les \u00e9l\u00e9ments qui donnent au sport ses lettres de noblesse, Ultimechs repr\u00e9sente le summum de la r\u00e9ussite athl\u00e9tique m\u00e9canis\u00e9e.", "short_description": "Les zones du but s\u2019illuminent. La foule hurle. Un Mech dernier cri p\u00e9n\u00e8tre dans l\u2019ar\u00e8ne. C\u2019est vous qui le contr\u00f4lez. Voici le Superball.\n\nDans Ultimechs, vous pilotez un Mech high-tech et tentez de devenir le champion du Superball. Atteignez l\u2019extr\u00e9mit\u00e9 du terrain avec votre co\u00e9quipier, puis pr\u00e9parez-vous \u00e0 sprinter, bloquer, frapper et marquer tous azimuts ! Votre objectif : d\u00e9crocher la victoire.\n\nAjoutez le jeu \u00e0 votre liste de souhaits et jouez gratuitement bient\u00f4t !"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "716710866096631", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ultimechs", "keywords": ["Multijugador", "gratis", "PvP", "deportes", "acci\u00f3n"], "long_description": "Prep\u00e1rate para entrar a la arena y comenzar tu primera temporada: \u00a1el futuro met\u00e1lico y brillante del deporte estar\u00e1 disponible gratis pronto!\n\nUltimechs te permite pilotar mecas de alto rendimiento de forma remota. Estos mecas compiten en un deporte futurista llamado superball, en el que deber\u00e1n abrirse paso en parejas a trav\u00e9s del campo de juego embistiendo, bloqueando y lanzando pu\u00f1etazos para alzarse con la victoria en la liga de superball m\u00e1s importante del mundo.\n\nHace falta m\u00e1s que engranajes, combustible y nervios de acero para ganar el campeonato de superball. Deber\u00e1s abonar el esp\u00edritu de la cooperaci\u00f3n para comunicarte, planear estrategias y reaccionar junto con tu par en las competencias 2 contra 2. \u00bfNo se te da bien jugar con otros? Puedes jugar Ultimechs en el modo 1 contra 1.\n\nUltimechs toma todos los aspectos que hacen grandiosos a los deportes de hoy y los combina con la inimaginable tecnolog\u00eda del ma\u00f1ana para dar lugar a lo m\u00e1ximo en ingenier\u00eda atl\u00e9tica.", "short_description": "Las porter\u00edas se iluminan. La multitud ruge. Un meca dise\u00f1ado a la perfecci\u00f3n entra a la arena bajo tu control. Te presentamos el deporte conocido como \"superball\".\n\nUltimechs te permite pilotar mecas potentes de forma remota. Estos compiten en un deporte llamado superball, en el que recorrer\u00e1n el campo de juego embistiendo, bloqueando y lanzando pu\u00f1etazos para ganar la liga de superball m\u00e1s grande del mundo.\n\n\u00a1Agr\u00e9galo a tu lista de deseados hoy y juega gratis a partir pronto!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "603919564676975", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ultimechs", "keywords": ["\u30de\u30eb\u30c1\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4", "\u7121\u6599", "PvP", "\u30b9\u30dd\u30fc\u30c4", "\u30a2\u30af\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3"], "long_description": "\u30a2\u30ea\u30fc\u30ca\u306b\u8db3\u3092\u8e0f\u307f\u5165\u308c\u3001\u30eb\u30fc\u30ad\u30fc\u30b7\u30fc\u30ba\u30f3\u3092\u59cb\u3081\u308b\u6e96\u5099\u3092\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3002\u91d1\u5c5e\u304c\u8f1d\u304f\u30b9\u30dd\u30fc\u30c4\u306e\u672a\u6765\u304c\u8fd1\u65e5\u516c\u958b\u65e5\u306b\u7121\u6599\u307e\u308b\uff01\n\n\u300eUltimechs\u300f\u3067\u3001\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u30fc\u306f\u30e1\u30ab\u3092\u9060\u9694\u64cd\u4f5c\u3057\u3066\u3001\u672a\u6765\u306e\u30b9\u30dd\u30fc\u30c4\u300c\u30b9\u30fc\u30d1\u30fc\u30dc\u30fc\u30eb\u300d\u306b\u53c2\u52a0\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u306b\u306a\u308b\u3002\u30c1\u30fc\u30e0\u30e1\u30a4\u30c8\u3068\u4e00\u7dd2\u306b\u30ba\u30fc\u30e0\u3001\u30d6\u30ed\u30c3\u30af\u3001\u30d1\u30f3\u30c1\u306a\u3069\u3092\u99c6\u4f7f\u3057\u3066\u5f97\u70b9\u3092\u7372\u5f97\u3057\u3001\u4e16\u754c\u6700\u9ad8\u306e\u30b9\u30fc\u30d1\u30fc\u30dc\u30fc\u30eb\u30ea\u30fc\u30b0\u3067\u52dd\u5229\u3092\u63b4\u3082\u3046\u3002\n\n\u300c\u30b9\u30fc\u30d1\u30fc\u30dc\u30fc\u30eb\u300d\u306e\u30c1\u30e3\u30f3\u30d4\u30aa\u30f3\u3068\u306a\u308b\u306b\u306f\u3001\u6f64\u6ed1\u6cb9\u3001\u71c3\u6599\u3001\u30ae\u30a2\u3060\u3051\u3067\u306a\u304f\u3001\u30c1\u30fc\u30e0\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u3082\u5fc5\u8981\u3068\u306a\u308b\u30022\u5bfe2\u306e\u8a66\u5408\u3067\u306f\u3001\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u30fc\u540c\u58eb\u306e\u30b3\u30df\u30e5\u30cb\u30b1\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3084\u6226\u7565\u3001\u304a\u4e92\u3044\u306e\u30b5\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u304c\u6b20\u304b\u305b\u306a\u3044\u3002\u30c1\u30fc\u30e0\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u304c\u82e6\u624b\u3067\u3082\u5927\u4e08\u592b\u3002\u300eUltimechs\u300f\u306f1\u5bfe1\u3067\u3082\u697d\u3057\u3081\u308b\u3002\n\n\u73fe\u5728\u306e\u30b9\u30dd\u30fc\u30c4\u306e\u7d20\u6674\u3089\u3057\u3044\u8981\u7d20\u3092\u3001\u672a\u6765\u306e\u60f3\u50cf\u3092\u7d76\u3059\u308b\u30c6\u30af\u30ce\u30ed\u30b8\u30fc\u3068\u878d\u5408\u3055\u305b\u305f\u300eUltimechs\u300f\u306f\u3001\u6280\u8853\u3068\u30b9\u30dd\u30fc\u30c4\u306e\u9802\u70b9\u3060\u3002", "short_description": "\u30b4\u30fc\u30eb\u30be\u30fc\u30f3\u304c\u5149\u308a\u3001\u89b3\u5ba2\u304c\u6b53\u58f0\u3092\u3042\u3052\u308b\u3002\u541b\u304c\u64cd\u7e26\u3059\u308b\u3001\u5b8c\u74a7\u306b\u4f5c\u308a\u4e0a\u3052\u3089\u308c\u305f\u30e1\u30ab\u304c\u30a2\u30ea\u30fc\u30ca\u306b\u5165\u5834\u3059\u308b\u3002\u7a76\u6975\u306e\u30b9\u30dd\u30fc\u30c4\u300c\u30b9\u30fc\u30d1\u30fc\u30dc\u30fc\u30eb\u300d\u306b\u3088\u3046\u3053\u305d\u3002\n\n\u300eUltimechs\u300f\u3067\u3001\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u30fc\u306f\u30e1\u30ab\u3092\u9060\u9694\u64cd\u4f5c\u3057\u3066\u3001\u672a\u6765\u306e\u30b9\u30dd\u30fc\u30c4\u300c\u30b9\u30fc\u30d1\u30fc\u30dc\u30fc\u30eb\u300d\u306b\u53c2\u52a0\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u306b\u306a\u308b\u3002\u30c1\u30fc\u30e0\u30e1\u30a4\u30c8\u3068\u4e00\u7dd2\u306b\u30ba\u30fc\u30e0\u3001\u30d6\u30ed\u30c3\u30af\u3001\u30d1\u30f3\u30c1\u306a\u3069\u3092\u99c6\u4f7f\u3057\u3066\u5f97\u70b9\u3092\u7372\u5f97\u3057\u3001\u4e16\u754c\u6700\u9ad8\u306e\u30b9\u30fc\u30d1\u30fc\u30dc\u30fc\u30eb\u30ea\u30fc\u30b0\u3067\u52dd\u5229\u3092\u63b4\u3082\u3046\u3002\n\n\u4eca\u3059\u3050\u30a6\u30a3\u30c3\u30b7\u30e5\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\u306b\u8ffd\u52a0\u3057\u3066\u3001\u306e\u672a\u6765\u304c\u7121\u6599\u3067\u8fd1\u65e5\u516c\u958b\uff01"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "574380477697139", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ultimechs", "keywords": ["kostenlos", "PvP", "Mehrspieler", "sport", "action"], "long_description": "Mach dich bereit, die Arena f\u00fcr deine Rookie-Saison zu betreten: Die metallische Zukunft des Sports ist kostenlos demn\u00e4chst verf\u00fcgbar!\n\nIn Ultimechs k\u00f6nnen Spieler Hochleistungsmechs in der Sportart \u201eSuperball\u201c aus der Ferne steuern und sich mit einem Teamkollegen bis an die Spitze vorarbeiten, w\u00e4hrend sie rasen, blocken, schlagen und punkten, um in der weltweit besten Superball-Liga den Sieg zu erringen.\n\nUm zum Superball-Champion zu werden, braucht es mehr als Schmier\u00f6l, Treibstoff und Ausr\u00fcstung \u2013 es braucht einen kooperativen Geist, wenn sich Spieler f\u00fcr eine 2-gegen-2-Partie zusammenschlie\u00dfen und mit ihrem Team kommunizieren, Strategien entwickeln und reagieren. Du spielst nicht gut mit anderen zusammen? Spieler k\u00f6nnen Ultimechs auch im 1-gegen-1-Modus erleben.\n\nUltimechs nutzt alles, was Sport heutzutage gro\u00dfartig macht, und kombiniert es mit der unvorstellbaren Technologie von morgen, um den Gipfel aller technisch-sportlichen Erfolge zu repr\u00e4sentieren.", "short_description": "Die Zielzonen leuchten auf. Die Menge br\u00fcllt. Ein perfekter, von dir gesteuerter Mech betritt die Arena. Willkommen bei der Sportart \u201eSuperball\u201c.\n\nIn Ultimechs k\u00f6nnen Spieler Hochleistungsmechs in der Sportart \u201eSuperball\u201c aus der Ferne steuern und mit einem Teamkollegen bis an die Spitze vorarbeiten, w\u00e4hrend sie rasen, blocken, schlagen und punkten, um in der weltweit besten Superball-Liga den Sieg zu erringen.\n\nF\u00fcge Ultimechs zu deiner Wunschliste hinzu und spiele demn\u00e4chst kostenlos! "}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "ultimechs_meta_comingsoon_logotransparent.png", "id": "2304630456360034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001732_2304630459693367_8645304323120701612_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NZ4HnzQ77GkQ7kNvwGX_aSP&_nc_oc=Adr1U0QaiqQxZwJ4YRAp8IGUPp7JWA2frq31-RsB85MON2G_--pRNIGMHwBe3jIe2TU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJE2OdNxmTio_U5Zr4nMsZW-6Qno5L00wi3nY1QyIeAnA&oe=6A9975DF"}, {"file_name": "ultimechs_meta_comingsoon_icon.png", "id": "1472522833209808", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035336_1472522836543141_6242944014141505721_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ag9Zs4GIJmcQ7kNvwEiTiso&_nc_oc=AdpZ_s-9mkONWQChvat3T0HYvOJNtRChrlxC3Iqu-xpukNR9TYROgqjyckHwL7rnyoo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIAC3p9lZyyTZdCVNPV-ENPTTsvCAkj0jL3n44s4JjMuw&oe=6A998DEF"}, {"file_name": "ultimechs_meta_comingsoon_heroart.png", "id": "1070668353845098", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974472_1070668357178431_7930208484584544027_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid